  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "保持空气清新",
   "texts": [
    "/rooms/living-room/how-to/frnuftig-fei4-nu3-fu2-ti2-kong1-qi4-jing4-hua4-qi4-de-shi3-yong4-fang1-fa3-pub0a9e8710",
    "NO",
    "ikea://cms/page-compatible-web?url=%2Frooms%2Fliving-room%2Fhow-to%2Ffrnuftig-fei4-nu3-fu2-ti2-kong1-qi4-jing4-hua4-qi4-de-shi3-yong4-fang1-fa3-pub0a9e8710&key=cn--zh--0a9e87102e6811ebbe205953a0920f61",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"/rooms/living-room/how-to/frnuftig-fei4-nu3-fu2-ti2-kong1-qi4-jing4-hua4-qi4-de-shi3-yong4-fang1-fa3-pub0a9e8710\",\"objectType_var\":\"cms/page-compatible-web\"}",
    "充足的新鲜空气有助于集中注意力，但你知道吗，你在室内呼吸的空气可能比外面街道的空气含有更多的污染物。在室内添置一台空气净化器（如全新FÖRNUFTIG 费努福提 空气净化器），可助你轻松优化室内空气，而且价格十分亲民。重要提示！使用空气净化器时，没有物体阻碍空气的流动，且没有人直接面向出风口，以免影响通风。",
    "保持空气清新"
   ],
